tual ideas, and answers to difficult questions.\n\nThat's why `grill-me` is so powerful - it's a universal tool you need in many different situations.\n\nYou can start with a fully fleshed out idea, or just a vague couple of sentences about what you want to build or figure out.\n\n## Getting Started\n\nInstall it using:\n\n```bash\nnpx skills@latest add mattpocock/skills\n```\n\nOr visit [the skills repo on GitHub](https://github.com/mattpocock/skills) to get started.\n","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]},"free":{"value":"true","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]},"has_video":{"value":"true","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]},"id":{"value":"post_qr4xd","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]},"image":{"value":"https://image.mux.com/PQ8mrDluvN2qGZqOMMSrtfYgWme9C02t7hkxJuNgTxwI/thumbnail.jpg?width=720\u0026height=405\u0026fit_mode=smartcrop\u0026time=0","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]},"mux_playback_id":{"value":"PQ8mrDluvN2qGZqOMMSrtfYgWme9C02t7hkxJuNgTxwI","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]},"popularity_30d":{"value":"5615","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]},"slug":{"value":"my-grill-me-skill-has-gone-viral","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]},"state":{"value":"published","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]},"summary":{"value":"Learn the \"Grill Me\" AI skill—a powerful technique to deeply explore coding plans, requirements, and ideas through structured AI conversations.","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]},"thumbnail_time":{"value":"0","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]},"title":{"value":"My 'Grill Me' Skill Went Viral","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]},"type":{"value":"post","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]},"updated_at_timestamp":{"value":"1774272930437","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]},"video_resource_id":{"value":"700414aa-4ddc-498e-8f07-22fbad2bd416-10eb5adca6457050879835f5fb57fabf.mp4","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]},"visibility":{"value":"public","matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[]}},"_rawTypesenseHit"